+# B human speech recognition — confirmed observation
+
+The user reported that the pending manual retry displayed the requested public test phrase, “여기서 주유하고 가자”. Read-only correlation on dedicated ADB5041/emulator-5572/user10 found the current attempt's foreground appMicrophoneRecording, stopMicrophone, appMicrophoneClosed, sdkPcmCompleted, started-recognition and finalText events, without a failure event. finalText is emitted only after the controller accepts an active, nonempty valid final and then transitions to READY. Phrase accuracy is the user's screen observation; the event log deliberately contains no recognized text. No audio or private transcript file was read or saved.
+
+The installed app APK SHA-256 was read and matches freeze7: `5b9eec0cca7f645e25ef4615cd5096d8e31b9256141d35f8d5018bc2c398317e`, corresponding to product source `105cd7ef5b47e194be1fbfd2271ba6d96c0fd32f`. Final arrived8026ms after the user's stop action and6084ms after PCM submission, within the15-second final wait. A read-only app-op check showed no active app recording. This is actual human microphone input, distinct from the earlier synthesized-speaker timeout and older supplied-PCM driver test. The earlier failures and their unknown cause remain preserved.
+
+This observation supersedes the earlier “latest human retest pending” statement only for B's successful recognition attempt. It does not prove a successful A trial, both-car cancel/foreground-exit/retry, edited draft/candidate screens, fontScale1.3/long text or two-car proposal/consent/native behavior. Overall independent verdict remains BLOCKED and PR #26 remains Draft. The historical verifier report stays bound to source105cd7e; no exact-head PASS is claimed for this evidence-only update.
+
+This was an already-pending user retry, followed by read-only observation and evidence closeout. No new product change, automated device scenario, build or test was started, and the previous120-minute bundle's deadline was not reset. The quoted sentence is the public phrase requested in chat, not an automatically collected private utterance.
